==================================================================================
SHARP ORDER OF THE CLUSTER INTEGRALS A_L  (sharpening HYP-2307)
==================================================================================

(1) ODD runs vanish EXACTLY (negation x->-x, chi(-1)=-1):
   p= 7: A_1=0, A_3=0, A_5=0  (all 0 expected)
   p=11: A_1=0, A_3=0, A_5=0  (all 0 expected)
   p=19: A_1=0, A_3=0, A_5=0  (all 0 expected)
   p=23: A_1=0, A_3=0, A_5=0  (all 0 expected)

(2) EVEN runs: A_{2k}/p^{k+1} -> c_k  (CONSTANT);  A_{2k}/p^{2k} -> 0.
    L=2 (k=1): predict A_2=p(p-1), A_2/p^2 -> 1 = c_1
      p |        A_2 |   A_2/p^2
      7 |         42 |   0.85714
     11 |        110 |   0.90909
     19 |        342 |   0.94737
     23 |        506 |   0.95652
     31 |        930 |   0.96774

    L=4 (k=2): predict A_4/p^3 -> c_2 = 2 ; A_4/p^4 -> 0
      p |          A_4 |   A_4/p^3 |   A_4/p^4
      7 |          336 |   0.97959 |  0.139942
     11 |         1760 |   1.32231 |  0.120210
