     13 |         -37440 |   -1.31088 | -0.0077567
     17 |        -163200 |   -1.95400 | -0.0067612
     19 |         361152 |    2.77125 |  0.0076766

(3) COMBINATORIAL c_k = #bigon-TREE pairings (V=k+1) of the 2k-walk:
     k | V-profile (V:count)                | c_k=count[V=k+1]
     1 | 2:1                                |                1
     2 | 3:2                                |                2
     3 | 2:1, 4:5                           |                5
     4 | 3:14, 5:14                         |               14
     5 | 2:8, 4:120, 6:42                   |               42
     6 | 3:330, 5:825, 7:132                |              132

    c_k sequence (k=1..): [1, 2, 5, 14, 42, 132]
    => leading coeff of A_{2k} is (-1)^k c_k  (sign from k bigons, chi(-1)=-1).
    Check against measured limits above: c_1=1, c_2=2, c_3=?(match A_6/p^4).

CONCLUSION: A_{2k}=Theta(p^{k+1}); since k+1<2k for k>=2, a_{2k}=0 for ALL
k>=2 (uniform, elementary leading order). Only a_2=1 survives => R(p)->e. QED-shape.
